1989, 1994, Abe 1991, 1994, Matsu'ura 1993, Shizuoka Prefecture Earthquake
Measures Section, 1993). From this:</font></font>
<br><img SRC="ys18.gif" height=107 width=634>
<br><font face="Century"><font size=+0>is obtained, and using this relationship,
equation (16) can be expressed as:</font></font>
<br><img SRC="ys19.gif" height=58 width=639>
<br><font face="Century"><font size=+0>[3] Method Based on the Difference
Between <i>M</i> of the Mainshock and <i>M </i>of the Largest Aftershock</font></font>
