<p><font face="Century"><font size=+0>In addition to these methods above,
it is necessary to compare other methods, for example, to survey the characteristics
of the region using that numbers of aftershocks follow negative binomial
distribution (Okada, 1979).</font></font>
<br>&nbsp;
<p><font face="Century"><font size=+0><a href="#Content">Back to content</a></font></font>
