<i>M</i>
= <i>M</i>*. Using&nbsp;<img SRC="kmtilde.gif" height=26 width=33 align=ABSCENTER>
in equation (26) and&nbsp;<img SRC="kbeta.gif" height=21 width=20 align=ABSCENTER>
